  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): brand-new project page. Add your voice. Draft until ready. -->\n<p class=\"\">A personal cable channel: every visitor sees the same YouTube video at the same second. A single-file Deno app with a stateless, deterministic playhead — live at <a href=\"https://tv.tools.ejfox.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://tv.tools.ejfox.com\">tv.tools.ejfox.com</a>.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The station mid-loop — everyone watching the same frame of the 224-hour broadcast\" class=\"\"><video class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/so_0,f_jpg,q_auto,w_1280/projects/tv-station/demo.jpg\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/q_auto/projects/tv-station/demo.mp4\" aria-label=\"The station mid-loop — everyone watching the same frame of the 224-hour broadcast\"></video><figcaption class=\"\">The station mid-loop — everyone watching the same frame of the 224-hour broadcast</figcaption></figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The TV station landing — tuned to the channel\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/tv-station/landing.png\" alt=\"The TV station landing — tuned to the channel\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/tv-station/landing.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/tv-station/landing.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/tv-station/landing.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/tv-station/landing.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The TV station landing — tuned to the channel\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:-1.97deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1440×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The TV station landing — tuned to the channel</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"tv.tools.ejfox.com live\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/tv-station/web-0.png\" alt=\"tv.tools.ejfox.com live\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/tv-station/web-0.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/tv-station/web-0.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/tv-station/web-0.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/tv-station/web-0.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"tv.tools.ejfox.com live\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.6deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1440×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">tv.tools.ejfox.com live</figcaption>\n</figure>",
